# TypeOK pairing: a cache miss reads a value outside the setting domain.
MODULE: TypeOKLoadReadsUndeclared
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a load captures a value that is not a setting at all
PERTURBS: BeginLoad

--- FIND
    /\ loadVal' = [loadVal EXCEPT ![s] = stored]
--- REPLACE
    /\ loadVal' = [loadVal EXCEPT ![s] = "Unknown"]
--- END
